---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: "Meet the Team — Excel Lawn Care, Buda TX"
description: "Meet the family behind Excel Lawn Care — owner Gye Hutson and the crew who have designed, built and maintained Central Texas landscapes since 1998."
---
{% import "partials/icons.njk" as ico %}

<section class="hero hero--page">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="hero__inner">
      <p class="hero__tagline">The people behind the work</p>
      <h1>Meet the team</h1>
      <p class="hero__sub">When you call Excel Lawn Care, you reach real people who've been serving Central Texas for decades — not a call center.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<nav class="wrap crumbs"><a href="/">Home</a><span>/</span>Meet the Team</nav>

<section class="section">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="grid grid-2" style="max-width:900px;margin:0 auto">
      <div class="card center">
        <div class="card__icon" style="margin:0 auto 16px;width:66px;height:66px;border-radius:50%">{{ ico.svg("compass") }}</div>
        <h3>{{ site.owner.name }}</h3>
        <p class="muted">{{ site.owner.title }}</p>
        <p>An Austin native who grew up near Lake Travis, Gye has spent his whole life reading Central Texas soil, sun and drought. He founded the family business in 1998 and launched Excel Lawn Care in 2007 for landscaping and hardscape work. He's the designer behind every project — and leads with the belief that your yard should be treated like his own.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card center">
        <div class="card__icon" style="margin:0 auto 16px;width:66px;height:66px;border-radius:50%">{{ ico.svg("mail") }}</div>
        <h3>{{ site.officeManager.name }}</h3>
        <p class="muted">{{ site.officeManager.title }}</p>
        <p>Megan keeps everything running — scheduling, questions, and the day-to-day that makes a project feel easy. Customers name-check her by name in their reviews, and for good reason: she's the friendly, on-top-of-it voice you'll hear when you call.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="center" style="margin-top:36px">
      <p class="muted narrow" style="margin:0 auto 20px">Behind Gye and Megan is a crew of skilled technicians and craftspeople — the same faces our long-time customers see year after year.</p>
      <a class="btn btn--primary btn--lg" href="/contact/">Work With Our Team</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{% include "partials/cta.njk" %}
